  "instructions": [
    "Heat a wok or large skillet over medium‑high heat and add 1 tbsp olive oil.",
    "Once the oil shimmers, toss in 2 minced garlic cloves and 1 tsp grated ginger, stir for 30 seconds until fragrant.",
    "Add the sliced Chinese broccoli and stir‑fry for 2 minutes, keeping it crisp.",
    "Pour in 2 tbsp low‑sodium soy sauce, 1 tbsp rice vinegar, 1 tsp sesame oil, and 1 tsp brown sugar, stirring to coat the vegetables.",
    "Sprinkle 1/4 tsp crushed red pepper flakes for a subtle heat and cook for another minute, ensuring the broccoli remains bright green and crunchy.",
    "Remove from heat and garnish with 2 sliced scallions before serving."
